      <h1>Google Business Profile + Local SEO for ENT + Eye Specialists — India + GCC + International 2026 Playbook</h1>
      <p class="lede">How to rank in Google Maps + local searches for a clinic in ENT + Eye Specialists? This guide covers costs, tactics, tools, timelines, compliance, and real outcomes from ITD GrowthLabs&#x27; work across 20+ clinic engagements in India + GCC. We help ENT + eye specialist practices attract premium patients across India + GCC + international. Serves all major India cities (Mumbai + Delhi + Bangalore + Ahmedabad + Hyderabad + Chennai + Pune + Kolkata + Gurgaon + Noida + Jaipur + Chandigarh + Thane + Navi Mumbai + Nashik + Nagpur + Lucknow + Indore + Kochi + Coimbatore), GCC (Dubai + Abu Dhabi + Sharjah + Riyadh + Jeddah + Doha + Kuwait City + Manama + Muscat), and international markets (London + Singapore + more).</p>
      <a class="book-cta" href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-doctors.php#packages">See Packages + Book Free Growth Audit &rarr;</a>
      <div class="cities">Serving India + GCC + International: Mumbai · Delhi · Bangalore · Ahmedabad · Hyderabad · Chennai · Pune · Kolkata · Gurgaon · Noida · Jaipur · Chandigarh · Lucknow · Indore + more</div>
